{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1511,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1735bf674e80e0665d8e9f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了鲷鱼最好吃的季节了呢。\r\n我常去的那家店，\r\n做的鲷鱼茶泡饭很美味哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a03e4b5db6d435eb9e38acf882df8f80c8e1ec5dbc37830c6efb87c2c4d5416",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bba5d15047baa533272df8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天去地方的远征会变多呢…\r\n为了让大家能有更舒适、\r\n更有收获的旅程，我必须尽力而为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda1575f4221a385b6ba95af09b9171e9841db1cdf47f7687b8617f9aa6acc92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3697fafb593fb182decaaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是用铁壶泡的茶最好…\r\n天气也逐渐转凉了、等小匠午休后\r\n给她泡上一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "945f581601af2f2479bb77c3109fdecf7995f105dbb3dcf73f053922c68d2b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31685d2dca49c38978300760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近越来越冷了…果然还是想要\r\n最新款的板式取暖器呢…啊，\r\n我是在说委员会的事。您不必在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec863534f683493eb8e1409e28ce682657c1a32f720b90df308fbc3166fefd68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dd07ada81d187d3fbbcd33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到骏骥同学热心维护校园治安，\n实在令我感激。毕竟有些问题\n不是一味地息事宁人就能解决的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4215d77d9a5cc19d6d224c99146a59c4fb2f413e8b7e4e79cdad96b08f7a75c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0894e3909b4370b17b1887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头的旅行目的真是难以捉摸呢。\n究竟是有明确的计划；还是随意的漫游。\n连我也揣测不透啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f2e36298f0d936aaee1de218ae89480e9f63d66668bc9c2138f5550c4bf498",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f8e9a903cff59f3d8eb076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常出现在道路旁和背景里的小真人偶…\n…真弓同学的创造力；\n是我所不具备的。有点意思——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc88b5444b8088015a7ced118aa24bb1f9b6b1c5ca3f06d2b8bc96fc8a78896f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e2256aaf1495e76824ea21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辣妹圈存在着她们独有的文化。\n呵呵，和佐敦同学的交流；\n真是极大的激发了我的求知欲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07a54503fa95513749bbdce2a339f94de9504ac70f4439a7b0a5c14e4f26aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe05fdf81c5df08dd2172540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天和紫丁同学约好了一起喝茶。\n和她共处的时光总是很愉快却又意犹未尽。\n小匠似乎也很喜欢她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5323b5055fb4515dba17cec20982a699d17444cfded4b016371843888aeb896b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ddf78367be1fedb072a2226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早，梳头打理的时候\n稍微要比平时多花了些时间。\n想利索的把头发盘起来也挺难呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "780957846fb2735728be23cdd0b85c93e9718561afa27a1dc777e69fb889d8dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b2edb074dee52815e2e275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐二选一；\n那不勒斯意面、亦或咖喱乌冬。\n没错，这是中山同学给我的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecf4067657f64652500f5623368b4d11eadda41f8309a5a22a0b54990cda4c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7187e11ea3c08d68cafaab18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快乐的时光总是短暂的呢。\n这个共享狂热与欢喜的特别之地。\n…真希望、派对能永远持续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7df67a0269f1e52cbad8419c9d6e055f7c8754a12c32d4591c028ce27183cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d468f899ca1815d263b7ebc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花盛开时固然绚丽；\n但花筏也别有一番风味哦。\n也许这就是所谓的余韵悠长吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2dcaaa3db1d8296be683f2a4f21411e5d0fcf0ed40fc0bd5e3d83c078519766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56cd142e38500402764e569c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头送给我和小匠\n一对红色T恤作为礼物。\n面料摸着就很好，穿着很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69dfe4f7cd7b48dc6254016411b45d9efc84d669d80c396f9f5da764cdeb28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5812e614b88bcd3ddebbb84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天；远征支援委员会就变得很忙。\n欧洲、美洲、大洋洲、\n亚洲…有种环球旅行的感觉呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c129e5237e4c6166de946fe18c6228cea4cff46fb867ea7797f01c8c585325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34926165457752740888dc0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪天显得寂静格外突出。\n正因如此；我始终无法喜欢上它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c9f85bc3550d3e0713b48b279a532390b8a66b98626ae5b3c875871b98b908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c9ae891dd294cd6dcd9368",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色象征着廉洁、和平、祝福…\n与圣诞派对正相称吧？\n希望；大家都能度过欢乐的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d5262d972246cdaa0525f570b27e792b2459aabd88f31e986a98696f81227f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9835dd4cc788de5e82d7160f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戒指和衣领链是爸爸送给小匠\n和我的圣诞礼物；上面的\n宝石叫灰色星光蓝宝石哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e2de20c02404aa912dc91313484181343dc0c006ded685ba89d2ddbcd7033f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c8b8002178aa3968dcbd7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们开始吧。训练项目\r\n就按之前说好的来进行 可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40738a82df977dd919c8ef39c7b9f43f648bfa3300d97efb40d467b028a7f5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d73233a7c26ab23c8e78cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参りましょうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6851bfc01905706cf7419d27a0521ce9e1aadf57863eabe72eeab0a66cda17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b456feef976f67ffb0caf33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是为了能稳步向\r\n目标旅途推进的训练。\r\n容不得一丝疏忽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f845d88aaf074568239a4d81d2c8133e3a580481f1ac7f60278249c9a24173",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:095c146e400d4cc33bc57372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该做什么您很清楚…对吧？\r\n那就，拜托您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fe650a2dc0e6ac68ab57c9ed8ed91ce0ac81e99078a256b15b76ee3f92ed54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353b48175324e498defc3c21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也按计划进行。…您很\r\n忙吧？不必因为顾及我\r\n而勉强自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441c2b0b4be2212036cf1ff9b126f1854f1947a43b73926dada944992b1ff3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47ffe4f544e812b02ec6783",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也按日程表来…\r\n怎么了？如果您有什么想法的话\r\n请尽管说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b98f1d8afa3f84cfcf2389b66402256044528d33d8f046d81978e5eecea0cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e8a85165aa87d6bb45c46c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进展很顺利…那么，\r\n今天也请拜托您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eda6824914bab2d0f9e36b6cae6e4b19b87d92aba81e4a38c117bdca3bdfc46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b250b9ee7526c8c69b99a8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练项目单，我已经确认过了。\r\n不愧是精心制定的训练计划…\r\n就按照这个来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4aefbe9519d3fa849d3deb4be6f12c794717f0909173819bbbc72b4643a5c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43262ad8f4fcaf60c372912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来之不易的机会。\r\n一刻也不能再浪费呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a646f551e93ad0ab0e89cdd20e680b798bd0d4156b1a0d1e08006dc3eebf0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81dec773a5d2715dafb14de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然是盛装出席就应优雅面对。\n这也是训练的一种呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d7cfe929d3a086397955c96d391eac58f7b00970859c6a073a59197b5d1ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d8360ad05d0c07051ccc42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，计划照旧即可。\n服装问题什么的无须担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0102d28a529b64a2e53e12f4d1045c16034998c16c0999aea940332bdb26fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac513c0dded5a2c82dd0243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不同的装束能转换心情\n嗯，的确如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f4ce042d5d766f77fe89735554775fd51996ce5fa6cca3e429019908ce38758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c41c0e5a8df8e371df2fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "\n『论白，比比谁更胜一筹？！』\n——我接到了阿船同学这样的宣战书。\n那么，接下来该如何应对呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a3e2b2ced88d05c7fa8bdbb7fd010e95609f0db0fabdd0bd65350ce794efe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724e88ea73e17af5ee6f5126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要因一点衣着的改变而扰乱平常心。\n呵呵，理应如此呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49337dcebbdd2b7ea349365a4f4e03ded565bd9c14121f6d4cb8797d249d5f29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4075fc37b8fe0f828217b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…看来你有些问题想问我。\n当然可以；训练结束之后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc421e540e1c0bd68c1082fb475ee3e4d1a201602c16c78b87c12b82f334989b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1acdd043ddba3ca456f9493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然；这身打扮自有它的目的性存在。\n那么，今天的训练项目是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af856e26f33612e8e3386bba74364e996e9cabb711562332623b8cd17a454c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a50a51925e8fe94342f28b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…真是段美好的旅途。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a27e9e2b909d6afe5ef5332e096bc0588c8c399c815de48e78ce68789ff72a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41192041f2688727255c870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您做得非常出色。我由衷感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81d0167413f2582c5a42ca5b12f878d6baa6e5624096de83574d94bcd3347c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9298bd25951b66adaa6b9afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一段热闹又喧嚣的旅程。有点令人不舍道别。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa5367b6734336b4c6c8f7e9d019345dde7619de831df32b96d65ca2ce95de71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08632bfbdd00676a7a46170f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "敬我们共行的旅途；干杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d003b0c1a0853437aeec50c83665a75a817d6b803b67d314de3c660e4b07ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0542dfba232b3acdc22750b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们又向前迈进了一步呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eefffc1c6bb5090e2d1239475cd4e43d51c73fce4f79a8ed9bc6f5ba833fa28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd2db555777a400abced9aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦之旅程、永无止境――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8616498efe4a04f05ae30793315f26613dfee2b31510a7c0f9b33edb481bd01c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cffa61ee2e3082deb03d12b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是梦之旅。\r\n还请多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "673aacb4c2c6e5c1f4945b5edb53b1b4627b218a18ffd42d847ba5e53772c6a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c1bdbf09758ee67a8533da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想亲眼见证“旅程的尽头”…\r\n这便是我的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1127052a27b81759e8ebd7c9aab3b058c3e508aec4c7c4632ab2ff5ae3bbe1c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49db6582c1f36479d45dc8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "では…加速ッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6725ac44f271c41ac62edfcdddbc622404c5130f527fd09f6d667a8d777db92e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c470bccebd71ffc0ae41522b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山とか谷とか関係ありません。\r\n私たちは夢への直線距離を最高速で\r\n踏破するのみ。そうでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f568f09a1bfff1df68fed86f7fa39fbe609bf3eef72943cd934abd43db347bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b3101cb1a47a954a4594d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a1a75b7403489a6da8ba11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf23cfeeb30ade506643248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちの光跡はあの日から始まった\r\n…来た道を振り返ってみて\r\nください。まさに一直線でしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd29bcd367beda208006f3e2c970ee5123d0973f1635b68699ca7e908afc2d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b381266a7d0447d5db787d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方が必要です。水上を駆けても\r\n崖を駆けても、観測者がいなければ\r\n意味がない。私のモチベ的にも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87981372f48bb26977543f88d568372d1d8a1eb377cb8fda3b0b31a1625bc38e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76e9107271369e51ee816c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ようやく正月気分ですか。…遅い。\r\n遅すぎる。私なんて12月上旬には\r\n新年に到達していましたよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fbf3fd24cd22f2a31819b342a1a0a89a7b0f2ee966cfe486d7ad6c3472e3c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692c31e3b7aaac2ceebb76d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコならすでに机に置いて\r\nおきましたよ。気づいた時には\r\n渡し終えている。それが私です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713669c0725ea73adef0d4fc3489715c794cb13c0b27973923d2f10dbe01acaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bebb73b81be0247dc0c826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私のチョコは調理時間を通常の\r\n100分の1に圧縮した光速チョコ。\r\n味は、食べてみてのお楽しみです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0680289832559a9129ea4add487dded66dbca4c1de93e6355c842b4833bcc5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e981d3ea6c9ebaa56fbbad2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "織姫も彦星も諦めが早いんです。\r\n光速なら会えない距離じゃないし、\r\n2人で走ればより早く会えるのに！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4d25cc4c50cc50117b25eb9dc1dc8edfd6686bae6995a77b2f6c0033a9d69e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5043aad3770b4e07a7dd5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私のハロウィンコスプレは“光”\r\nです。…どうやってなりきるか？\r\n1日中最高速で走りまわるんです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "579382710d75c59e0713de602ec5e11a35ca1fa2773700480e399ddade2a0497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247f0354f9e2a712a8419c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔はサンタを探して街中を駆け回っ\r\nていました。プレゼントを止まって\r\n待つなど私の流儀に反しますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4843dadfc2a3fbb3d6027ef4806e07e230f76fa8dbf86cbe897667fc25a16334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c5bcd057625b326706ef3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼き日、サンタよりもらった振ると\r\nビカビカ光る靴…これで貴方に\r\n最速イルミネーションを贈ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b83c5a55fc1b232f3102b0b2384afecf9febd2a349e41a3c7e78a3c9393c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66943e04c69a00c549d268f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速を感じられたな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77149246beb74e8805a52d0362f599de7ba5edd5d43f7026f19ae0cea241ce63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f62f7750a244237375c0d1fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園最速で大掃除を終えたのは\r\n私でしょうね。なにしろ先月には\r\nすでに済ませていましたから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b5c7ecbba262cac2792dd3364057d620fa4cb6b8ead71fe11a9b2fc2fe9605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90998d068fb5b0659f7ef840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい、おめでとー！…ビックリ\r\nしましたか？したでしょうが。\r\n私はおめでとうも最高速なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7083fbc4a82e32de8358de81dabcc85239a3ec5640f978df6e53ba177befb19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728825476dc9da6fa419c43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼント、なにがいいですか。\r\nいや、聞くまでもありませんね…。\r\nとっくに買ってしまっているので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52bfda88772b06cd5496c88da1d5191920825fe3e94c1da17a035ad996c735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cba7a8d3f1b100d66b88e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光速で生きていると、実時間との\r\n差が生じ、誕生日の計りようがない\r\nのです…が！お祝いは受付中です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "455a7edcf5e6d7345d42d2566f8b9331edb9b012ef94d5aab4083522bc69c432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d362b5005ae8a578b94dfeea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日プレゼント？“ニャンコ”！\r\n“ニャンコ”がいいですっ！\r\n“ニャンコ”ならばなんでも…っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1ccb04695459e4d753bcce46bb5dbcb8d5304eadd9331545ce39159d1af707",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dcc229898efb0ead9a6ee8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方にお知らせがきていましたよ。\r\nさ、即開封しましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93104e4b5b53e89c1ea135d5f9ce1c2a9ba900937aa7b22025824e5e0406f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9109377e8510fbafe258f9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントを開けましょう。\r\n“足”の早さ最高速の品かも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe375eedf9d8fc5e4ee6bf90452c6be4ab519de076f668135e5df3b97d908ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ff5a96e422adca0601fa14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気づいた時にはミッション完了。\r\nフッ、速すぎてしまったか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b5a9f3e9633b6053763aa012e82e3a2ce5f4eb92c7eb298538d6ba779e0e9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e81b9edd88d979ca247aa61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近々イベントが開催されます。\r\n参加しましょう。なんなら\r\n始まる前に終わらせましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494408abba6f2ece2598fac1dd371b025344aebbaafba23552d1995abdf05804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc4cdb1d6ab33ed0e0a1f83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント開催中です。最速完走記念\r\nパーティーの会場は予約完了。\r\nスピーチ原稿も執筆済で安心です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf97f56296fca834651ff9b68cbf47d90601b2c0d2c0a054df14561332d9a8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79decc35e9fbf6bf86b4e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失速したか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939e6cdc3e576e7e1d46b22d6b409a4d748b08600db239e404647f33aad59b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b93f9b14af0dd880a6f118c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが上がったそう\r\nです。最速で見に行きましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0efdfce6d923ae9a6ebc8477bf01b31b064940f0a289517f44d55c1868c75b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d07783981b9fb47262a7513a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なかなかの速さ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6c347f4831e3e8263fce927fa1f856d7bfbf86d5b6dc136c9263b0cbd1c27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3aa22f0ec1a1d0213e7bf34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光の壁を抜けたか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c8ea504f08eec0a8a056503fdc8d6cc22a495bbe875899e8c79aec97c20c05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d54dd71cebee1dcbf2e6d09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失速したか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939e6cdc3e576e7e1d46b22d6b409a4d748b08600db239e404647f33aad59b2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce67fa3125ebdcc96db5a637",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なかなかの速さ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a6c347f4831e3e8263fce927fa1f856d7bfbf86d5b6dc136c9263b0cbd1c27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e32eade9bc9c6af4ea30fb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速でぶち抜いたぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c57806a6b6f08583c68d28a5963911ee1e485e97f5d780a50d5908c816dddcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5d9e80aed220977524c2be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ、光速チーム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c955ae95e6e2086698d4cc336236c5d6ac0f72121160ae0d496d3ac278b8148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff32d11f9cd4e59761878ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce1f6d6f61a08d0e1577b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速を目指して、\r\n今日もトレーニングあるのみ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0580602ee59ff68a330f19c8f48eadbe289b4969515cdbe2cc82be12710357c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29460843896cd8d7f813fe5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園の歴史は長いが…\r\nフッ、光の速読術で\r\n一気に読破してみせる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "820136521dcb1acd3ba2cd280d2fb2bcbc3a3c5d9dd14f2e9f76cde8e4f555d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5865248c96dac6856b6a5292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースですか？\r\n今日も最高速を\r\n更新していきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85b86f989212007577346e74964b1bc7a1acf7a964fd60bcaf7528ef85636fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ab80a2d2fa0f021d8c15d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec94c5c72cc7fe8451771a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この光は…\r\n負けてたまるかっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a52c026d67433877b519603c6c542fb8e5c8944907f1f4ad524f9e2b85ac600b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "120000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
